/-!
# G.12: Subgroups containing transvections on hyperplanes

The shared inputs retain the literal point radical, its full action on the
perpendicular hyperplane, and the original faithful module in G.12.12.
The hyperplane identification and orbit transport prove G.12.12(2)--(3)
conditional only on the invariant symplectic form of part (1). They also
construct all G.12.1 hypotheses for KQ, and for H when it preserves the form.

These results do not yet assert G.12.1's recognition theorem or the complete
G.12.12. Existence of the form, recognition, and the ambient-normalizer
alternative of G.12.12(4) remain to be proved and assembled in this section.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004), §G.12,
printed pp.370--375. The two classification applications are in G.10.15,
printed pp.362--363.
-/
